  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Wright County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/wright-county-mn</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-wright-county-mn</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Emergency 1-year moratorium (Ord. 26-2), unanimous. Applies to unincorporated areas only. Moratorium Workgroup formed Jun 16 to evaluate environmental, fiscal, infrastructure, and land use considerations</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Washington County: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
